      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228393/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix onion with lime juice in a small bowl and allow to stand for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, toss shrimp, roma tomatoes, cucumber, celery, jalapeno, salt, and black pepper in a medium bowl until thoroughly combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk tomato and clam juice cocktail, ketchup, cilantro, and hot pepper sauce in a separate bowl; stir dressing into shrimp mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tXJe1bVhrpvDovCLjnZ2NFVOsYM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/228393-authentic-mexican-shrimp-cocktail-coctel-de-camarones-estilo-mexicano-ddmfs-step-2-26bdeaade5ec4c85bb17146c1ef950e5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/228393/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently fold in avocados. Stir in onion mixture. Cover and chill thoroughly, at least 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
